---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions — Finora"
  description="Finora Terms & Conditions. Read about usage terms, data sources, and limitations."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 lg:py-24">
    <div>
      <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.25em] text-ink-3 uppercase">// legal</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest text-ink-3 uppercase">Last updated: August 28, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          By accessing or using Finora (the "Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions.
          If you do not agree, do not use the Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">2. Nature of the Service</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Finora is a financial research and information tool. It reads publicly available financial data —
          primarily from SEC EDGAR filings — and computes standard financial metrics using deterministic algorithms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">3. Not Investment Advice</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          <strong class="text-ink">Finora does not provide investment advice, recommendations, or opinions
          about the value of any security.</strong> Nothing on the Service should be construed as an offer to
          buy or sell any security. Consult a qualified financial advisor before making investment decisions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">4. No Brokerage Relationship</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Use of Finora does not create a broker-client, advisor-client, or any other fiduciary relationship.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">5. Data Sources &amp; Accuracy</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Finora derives financial data from public sources including SEC EDGAR XBRL filings, company
          investor relations materials, and third-party market data providers. <strong class="text-ink">You should
          independently verify all material information</strong> before relying on it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">6. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Finora relies on third-party APIs (SEC EDGAR, Twelve Data, Tavily, Jina, NVIDIA) to provide
          its features. These services may become unavailable or change without notice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">7. Service Availability</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Finora makes no guarantee of uninterrupted or error-free service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">8. Usage Limitations</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Research runs and chat messages are subject to usage limits. Automated scraping or abuse is prohibited.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">9. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The Finora platform, design, and algorithms are proprietary to Finora Labs. SEC data is public domain.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">10. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Finora Labs shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising
          from your use of the Service. The Service is provided "as is" without warranties.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">11. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Questions? Contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@finora.dev" class="font-semibold text-annotate-blue hover:underline">hello@finora.dev</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
